   "status": "amber",
   "why": "Phones and PCs are still half of MLCC units. In 2018 and 2022 the consumer slump started the destock even while auto and industrial held.",
   "green": "Phone and PC units growing",
   "amber": "Flat or soft units while AI carries the cycle",
   "red": "Units falling >5% YoY with rising OEM inventory",
